 (text "Board input: eFuse from the drive board VSYS" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (thickness 0.5) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "aa10fc2e-170a-582d-8885-63df70feca93"))
(text "TPS259474A: on when the drive board raises STK_POWER_EN (it also holds a 100k pull-down there)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "8458b260-1146-553c-adec-85630763ab55"))
(text "Output is Antmicro net POE_OUTPUT: Antmicro ideal diode Q16/Q14 -> VCC_IN -> soft start Q18 -> VCC." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "3f9af3a9-4a04-5b55-8817-20c32c30dbf8"))
(text "ILIM 665 Ohm = 5.0 A (RILM = 3334 / ILIM). Worst case load about 3.3 A at 12 V (module 25 W, NVMe, camera)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 43.18000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "2ea3a947-97e3-5ff6-913b-a55b82dda2dc"))
(text "OVLO 150k / 10k: off above 19.2 V (pack maximum 16.8 V). dV/dt 2.2 nF: about 0.9 V/ms." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 48.260000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "a44c1cf6-f4cf-5891-802e-45035f9777a7"))
(text "Circuit breaker timer 4.7 nF: about 3.9 ms at 1.2 x ILIM before it trips, then auto-retry." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "d809b073-2e11-5df3-8b89-1b2b650e8662"))
